title: Let a target hide some backlinks.
pid: e67612af-b41c-47e2-97b4-94220dd8fe9b
body: |2-
  Don't present a hidden link source under 'hidden for no reason'
  just because no subscribee-as-such contains it.
  If a target can hide backlinks,
  the number of potential reasons to hide something
  has grown from what was imagined when
  the current <2026-10-01 Thu> skg was written.
